{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026W3BUi86Tkf1794868343.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>百度第三季扭虧為盈，賺13.6億元人民幣，去年同期蝕113億元人民幣。經調整純利近24億元人民幣，按年跌三成六。期內收入下跌百分之1，至308億元人民幣。</p><p></p><p>集團預期將於今年底前宣布首次派息，具體須經過董事會批准，並視乎屆時市場情況而定。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-16T23:45:14.193380+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":118,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-16T22:22:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-17T16:30:39.306952+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-16T23:38:23.882909+00:00","content_hash":"6df39f24dc7ce234fd02c7914d5c3ac4ec41696aff76fd81f2244136f4f0da69","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-16T23:45:14.193380+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}